{"type":"message","id":"673d6912","parentId":"2fbfc2c5","timestamp":"2026-04-27T07:01:20.500Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-04-27 15:01 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 你是 breakdown-aligner。请对下面这份最终超贴合版《斗破苍穹》第1批（第1-6章）剧情拆解进行严格质量检查，只输出 PASS 或 FAIL，并在 FAIL 时给出精炼问题清单与修改建议。重点检查：是否真正抓住主线冲突、钩子强度是否准确、是否有冗余铺垫、分集是否合理、是否符合漫剧快节奏改编。\n\n待检查草案：\n\n### 第 1 批（第 1-6 章）\n\n**批次概要**：萧炎在“天才坠落成废柴”的尊严危机中，又遭纳兰嫣然携云岚宗当众退婚，尊严被彻底踩碎，最终被逼到立下雪耻反击之誓。\n**核心冲突数**：1 条主冲突线 + 2 次升级节点（⭐⭐⭐）\n**高强度钩子数**：3 个（10-8 分）\n**覆盖集数**：第 1 - 第 4 集\n\n- 【剧情1】场景：萧家测试广场与山崖夜谈，族人与同辈 对 萧炎 当众宣布他只剩斗之力三段并集体羞辱，随后萧战又告诉他一年后成年仪式若还不到七段，就会被踢出家族核心，萧炎的天才坠落与尊严危机被彻底坐实，情绪钩子：群体羞辱 + 倒计时危机（9 分），第 1 集，状态：未用\n- 【剧情2】场景：萧家大厅，云岚宗来客与纳兰嫣然 对 萧家 强势登门压场，并在众目睽睽下正式提出解除婚约，萧炎当场看清这场登门不是结亲，而是踩着自己与父亲的脸退婚，情绪钩子：身份压迫 + 当众退婚（10 分），第 2 集，状态：未用\n- 【剧情3】场景：萧家大厅，聚气散、炼药师名头、长老与族人的态度以及纳兰嫣然的施舍姿态 对 萧炎父子 接连形成压迫，长老和族人迅速倒向退婚一方，萧炎父子的尊严被进一步踩到谷底，情绪钩子：群体倒戈 + 施舍羞辱（7 分），第 3 集，状态：未用\n- 【剧情4】场景：萧家大厅，纳兰嫣然与满堂族人 对 萧炎 把他逼到再无退路，萧炎在尊严被彻底踩碎后定下雪耻反击之誓，拒绝施舍，也绝不再任人践踏，情绪钩子：尊严反击 + 立誓雪耻（10 分），第 4 集，状态：未用"}],"timestamp":1777273280486}}
{"type":"message","id":"4edb963b","parentId":"673d6912","timestamp":"2026-04-27T07:01:47.064Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating episode performance**\n\nI’m looking to determine if the episode passes or fails. It seems likely to fail because it feels stretched out, especially with the redundancy in the hall scene from parts 2 to 4. Also, the hook doesn’t seem to have the intensity expected, given that it's deemed underrated. I need to assess how these factors impact the overall effectiveness of the episode.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0972b77559a296e80169ef09c7d5fc8191a69bd673d9ef8133\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp7wnPcDhXF45FYg2jnhqeQTj9rEtYg_j9Goh2fhnyO1eQTobIQrMDCOzvustBJ1XaNCZlfU3AqP7rnFrg3GFqCjYJWZHXoImTzJqvuC0wckHMjDpUUd-_kWFkZoyh3AwBmw5xTJFForizoHY-qomrPlEbF8mbFED7HQzIFnhNf9FsOhIaTlUENQnA-Hr2DALILlZmxiLShDSuL0Ae71k9wHemGvQ5dW_Lr5joVa5YkgBtoAPTR98L5dUjmVZaSPfVOYnCdxt5o4ZoORVB_JNNt0zc59_FSRfh528FnVcyETkmNYJAkuXAFa6poR9GPPc0kJaqjAfOj3hdgSKYvvoqXZDKiVzXkBo68IMvacFpVd1WwCNaMxa6khgOV_7AVI88L5ZhisAr7zgME1wlhcZjd0cqO2xwP1v7PMMZ7eN8GkNrHAjX-OFAMCzaOSCJOV5SIAhTB11bU-5h0_-BgxYYoA0I9WPw6Asz0gHVnwWFFNnApEeIM2WPFPq7rc1swVDc7I45gey51q_tUNpZ0uKV-lqrhJXA4xdup7h0X5jF_wnH4L7wJ-cgIINOQNhnXYG9hmbUHR75-cytAv8lWOCnascLH6prR7HfNsGyW0LBbTP7Kh_VfXbe4Ytv-EczWP4KcCn29CTAAZj_2-AiSDM2m7fDcmF3FLJu88dxApySdY496xaYyqFti0LAUE0aJcK4aoiMAPlQ5WJxO412-aZ1Gf0vinMKl8KwKNTpGiRyLOqG5lz0SzWxs4s9WdJSlO4ewRwOAIuIO24CUvi0UXzdyLXFWqEi0XGQ300GKmJAgwyL1ZKOHMjpKDDf4lOCGAqiDn4xwYU7LwkAsyDpFWJTyqh_pISak7HZPD0ld43UtzVSs5f2M__ochbXB-1ELdCd7J7Z-AEt9zONHUxDlHAO5GXao0Zq66PxtnQtbp6PNHfaw_Fpaxn0Mg8C6wBKnadPWecRpOYViTD96MH9k-CwQEFYTHCM2x6eSWbI0h62g7gem_7v6jKcbL4RRjKUAV_B5O8ZLolY4F5FGNqgGXcsml64f4sRm9eNFvRSZB5DitF7wHsemINs_q0o2ymKSp9oiU51og4GL-U4sp6-b78NI6GUPVdMcXzq58oriu2FJJEcMby9jevFhiISmf0OXZ643aWxok6ilk5ASwYlmaEUTx4kBkBAd-JAsdie8csnqYViHfM=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating episode performance**\\n\\nI’m looking to determine if the episode passes or fails. It seems likely to fail because it feels stretched out, especially with the redundancy in the hall scene from parts 2 to 4. Also, the hook doesn’t seem to have the intensity expected, given that it's deemed underrated. I need to assess how these factors impact the overall effectiveness of the episode.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"FAIL\n\n问题清单：\n1. 主线冲突抓得基本对，但“废柴坠落”与“退婚羞辱”两段没有清晰区分主因果，当前更像同类羞辱并列，主线聚焦还不够锋利。\n2. 第2-4集几乎都堆在“萧家大厅退婚压迫”同一事件链上，拆成3集偏碎，节奏拖，漫剧爽点释放不够利落。\n3. 【剧情3】本质仍是退婚事件的中段施压，信息增量不足，属于冗余铺垫，单独成集支撑力弱。\n4. 钩子强度标注不够准确，【剧情3】只有7分却被放进“高强度钩子数3个”，统计自相矛盾；且其钩子级别也不足以撑一集结尾。\n5. 分集合理性不足，前4集都在“受辱”，反击释放太晚，连续压抑容易削弱追更欲。\n6. “第1-6章覆盖4集”略显偏慢，不够符合漫剧快节奏改编，应该更强调事件推进和情绪爆点密度。\n\n修改建议：\n1. 明确主线为“废柴萧炎在退婚羞辱中被逼立誓逆袭”，把“废柴处境”作为起势，把“退婚”作为核心爆点。\n2. 压缩大厅戏，把【剧情2】【剧情3】合并，避免同一场景反复施压。\n3. 建议改成3集结构更顺：\n   - 第1集：测试坠落 + 倒计时危机\n   - 第2集：云岚宗登门退婚 + 满堂倒戈\n   - 第3集：施舍羞辱顶满 + 萧炎立誓反击\n4. 若坚持4集，第3集必须补充明显新爆点，否则会塌节奏。\n5. 统一钩子统计口径，只把真正能做集尾追更点的内容算高强度钩子。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0972b77559a296e80169ef09cf83588191a48f479a6ac179d8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9891,"output":538,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11965,"cost":{"input":0.024727500000000003,"output":0.00807,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03318150000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777273280500,"responseId":"resp_0972b77559a296e80169ef09c4cea0819180775e31f46b73ee"}}
